---
description: Enforce build verification after changes
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.js", "**/*.jsx"]
---

After modifying any source file:
1. Run `npm run build` (or the project's build command)
2. If it fails, read the FULL error output
3. Fix the root cause — do not add workarounds or type assertions
4. Rebuild and confirm zero errors before reporting done

After modifying any TypeScript file:
1. Run `npx tsc --noEmit`
2. Fix all type errors before moving on
